    "body": "unify context-switching logic. add tests to avoid regressions.\r\n\r\n1. `prevwin` is now restored for all targets (was buf-only).\r\n2. The buf-found \"restore the shown buffer\" dance no longer depends on the origin window: it runs even if the callback closed the origin.\r\n\r\nfollowup to https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40661\r\nrelated to https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/7257",
